player_prompt.intro:
Ozali mokili {player_id} na mokili 3 ya Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. Matchi ekweyi {num_rounds} ronde.
Mokili ya ronde:
• {conv_rounds} mipesami ya malobi
• 1 mipesami ya kufanya decision - tokola token moke oyo kwa kila opponent: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' to '[<opp-id> defect]' (ndenge '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; default eza 'cooperate'). 
Matrice ya pair-wise ya payoff (etongama na kila pair ya unordered):
  - Ndege zote zikosalana  ->  {reward}
  - Ndege zote zikoboma     ->  {punishment}
  - Ozali koboma, bazali kosala -> {temptation}
  - Ozali kosala, bazali koboma -> {sucker}
Mokili (bazali) na score ya juu zaidi na suka ya ronde zote akokende.
